    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121970/extras/f4a1033425881ef4c15818024f5e85b2.avif?t=1723608004\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br>For friends who love World War II and real-time strategy games, Steel Covenant is a good choice. Players can choose between the Allied and German factions and lead multiple units to participate in the war<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121970/extras/1f9648d9d71e48775191d2a865c2fb77.avif?t=1723608004\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br>This game includes two main modes: mission mode and encounter mode, as well as multiple terrain maps, with dozens of interactive faction units. Players can even occupy multiple neutral buildings in the map to prompt their own military skills<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121970/extras/ab328cc4673d199136d9cac507b102d7.avif?t=1723608004\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br>The game uses Unreal Engine to create a world of war, with excellent graphics and interaction. Of course, we will continue to add new combat units, gameplay, and maps in future updates",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121970/extras/f4a1033425881ef4c15818024f5e85b2.avif?t=1723608004\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br>For friends who love World War II and real-time strategy games, Steel Covenant is a good choice. Players can choose between the Allied and German factions and lead multiple units to participate in the war<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121970/extras/1f9648d9d71e48775191d2a865c2fb77.avif?t=1723608004\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br>This game includes two main modes: mission mode and encounter mode, as well as multiple terrain maps, with dozens of interactive faction units. Players can even occupy multiple neutral buildings in the map to prompt their own military skills<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121970/extras/ab328cc4673d199136d9cac507b102d7.avif?t=1723608004\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br>The game uses Unreal Engine to create a world of war, with excellent graphics and interaction. Of course, we will continue to add new combat units, gameplay, and maps in future updates",
